From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TOTK Turnip integration <totk-turnip@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 04:22:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] tu/kgsl: suballocate command streams from reusable mapped
 slabs

Keep real parent BO identities with per-stream slice bounds, reuse freed page ranges and retain only bounded empty slab caches. Default to pooled storage on KGSL with startup TU_DEBUG=noslabcs opt-out. Add BOS slice/slab attribution and native production-CS storage invariant tests.
